      "name": "普通操作按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "PanelButtonStyle()：macOS 26 使用 glass，旧系统使用 bordered。此处用浏览器原生按钮示意状态，不模拟 Liquid Glass。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button\" type=\"button\">刷新</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button{appearance:auto;font:13px system-ui}.ds-button:hover{cursor:default}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:auto}.ds-button:disabled{color:GrayText}"
    },
    {
      "name": "突出操作按钮",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "PanelButtonStyle(prominent: true)：保存、下载等操作。HTML 采用系统强调色示意，不是原生控件的像素复刻。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-prominent\" type=\"button\">保存</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-prominent{appearance:auto;font:13px system-ui;background:Highlight;color:HighlightText}.ds-button-prominent:hover{cursor:default}.ds-button-prominent:focus-visible{outline:auto}.ds-button-prominent:disabled{color:GrayText}"
